---
const sourceHtml = `<header class="ah">
  <div class="w"><div class="ah-b">
    <div>
      <div class="ah-kick"><i></i><span>Category Archive</span></div>
      <h1>Business</h1>
    </div>
  </div></div></header><section class="pl"><div class="w">
  <div class="pl-h">
    <div>
      <div class="pl-eye"><i></i><span>Most recent first</span></div>
      <div class="pl-t">Latest Reporting</div>
    </div>
    <div class="pl-c">Page 1 of 18</div>
  </div>
  <div class="pl-l">
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-1.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Markets</div>
        <div class="pr-t">Index Funds Now Hold a Quarter of the Market. Few Investors Voted.</div>
        <p class="pr-x">Passive ownership has grown faster than the governance rules written for it, leaving fund managers casting ballots on behalf of millions of people who never saw the resolution.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Denise Chapman</div><div class="pr-dt">Sept 18</div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-2.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Labor</div>
        <div class="pr-t">The Reclassification That Moved 40,000 Workers Off the Payroll</div>
        <p class="pr-x">An internal job-code change converted warehouse staff to contract status. The company calls it a title correction; the workers lost overtime the same week.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Denise Chapman</div><div class="pr-dt">Sept 16</div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-4.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Retail</div>
        <div class="pr-t">Forty New Storefronts Before the Holidays, and a Quiet Rent Clause</div>
        <p class="pr-x">The rollout covers eleven states. In eight of them, the leases carry an exit provision most landlords did not negotiate.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Nicholas Griffin</div><div class="pr-dt">Sept 14</div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-3.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Economy</div>
        <div class="pr-t">Shipping Costs Fell for Six Months. Shelf Prices Did Not.</div>
        <p class="pr-x">Freight rates have returned to pre-surge levels across three major lanes. Retail pricing has moved four percent the other way.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Denise Chapman</div><div class="pr-dt">Sept 11</div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-5.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Companies</div>
        <div class="pr-t">A Headquarters Move Was Announced Twice, With Different Numbers</div>
        <p class="pr-x">The first filing put the job count at 1,200. The press release said 3,000. Neither figure has a schedule attached.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Denise Chapman</div><div class="pr-dt">Sept 9</div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-about.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Companies</div>
        <div class="pr-t">The Board Vote That Happened Before the Board Met</div>
        <p class="pr-x">Minutes record a unanimous decision at a meeting two directors say they did not attend. The company declined to explain the discrepancy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Catherine Palmer</div><div class="pr-dt">Sept 5</div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-1.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Markets</div>
        <div class="pr-t">A Small-Cap Listing Doubled on a Filing Nobody Read Closely</div>
        <p class="pr-x">The prospectus discloses a related-party arrangement on page 94. The trading volume suggests most buyers stopped at the summary.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Denise Chapman</div><div class="pr-dt">Sept 2</div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-2.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Labor</div>
        <div class="pr-t">Overtime Claims Are Up. The Office That Reviews Them Lost Staff.</div>
        <p class="pr-x">Filings have risen by a third over two years while the review unit shrank by nearly half, according to internal staffing rosters.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Nicholas Griffin</div><div class="pr-dt">Aug 29</div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-3.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Economy</div>
        <div class="pr-t">The Tariff Line That Changed a Definition, and With It a Bill</div>
        <p class="pr-x">One reclassified category moved thousands of shipments into a higher duty bracket. Importers learned when the invoices arrived.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Denise Chapman</div><div class="pr-dt">Aug 26</div></div>
    </a>
    <a href="#" class="pr">
      <div class="pr-img" style="background-image: url(&quot;/blog-placeholder-4.jpg&quot;);"></div>
      <div>
        <div class="pr-cat">Retail</div>
        <div class="pr-t">A Loyalty Program Changed Its Terms. The Notice Ran to 4,000 Words.</div>
        <p class="pr-x">Members were told the update was routine. Three of the new clauses narrow what a point is worth and when it expires.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pr-m"><div class="pr-by">Denise Chapman</div><div class="pr-dt">Aug 22</div></div>
    </a>
  </div></div></section><section class="pg"><div class="w"><div class="pg-in">
  <a href="#" class="on">1</a><a href="#">2</a><a href="#">3</a><span class="gap">…</span><a href="#">18</a><a href="#" class="nx">Next →</a></div></div></section>`;
